WEBVTT

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:06.410
By kissing Muneakira, she becomes a master samurai.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.870
So...

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.870
Wait just a moment!

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:14.920
I'm not kissing her because I want to, either!

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.420
This solution is just too-

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.090
"I can't throw out a girl who lost her memories!" You're the one who said that, Muneakira!

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.260
Yeah, but...

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.810
I have to accept the fact that Jyuubei is a decent samurai.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:36.730
Besides, since the Field of Evil Restraint and Destruction didn't work, that means she's not an evil being.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:41.360
However, that doesn't change the fact that Jyuubei is a dangerous girl.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:46.030
Fortunately, Jyuubei is completely harmless if she doesn't kiss Muneakira.

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:50.740
In other words, we're safe if you don't kiss her! Understand?

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:52.280
I-I understand.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.040
I object.

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:59.750
If that contract also works with samurai other than Jyuubei...

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:03.010
It'd be a waste to seal away Muneakira's kiss.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:10.140
Kiss me and turn me into a master samurai!

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:48.950
Y-Y-Y-Y-You massive forehead bitch!

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.950
How can you even call yourself an indirect descendant of Yamato Nadeshiko?!

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:53.700
Learn what embarrassment is!

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:54.490
Silence.

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:59.750
The shadow that looms over Great Japan; its threat has not dissipated.

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:03.460
Eventually this country will face its greatest crisis.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:06.550
What will we need at that time?

00:03:06.550 --> 00:03:08.840
The elegance of Yamato Nadeshiko?

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.840
The embarrassment of the maiden?

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:11.720
No!

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:16.970
The phenomenal power of the master samurai will save our country!

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:18.640
Am I incorrect?!

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:24.480
Sadly, the number of master samurai protecting Great Japan is dwindling.

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:26.520
So, Tokugawa Sen!

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:30.360
As the princess of the Tokugawa household,

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:35.240
isn't it only appropriate that you at least have the will to volunteer and try kissing Muneakira?

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:39.040
Th-That doesn't mean I can just kiss him!

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:44.080
Well this <i>is</i> a human experiment, in a way.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.250
The contract ritual is a kiss.

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:49.380
The general who kissed becomes unable to move.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:53.220
When one becomes a master samurai, their personality suddenly changes.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:56.930
All this had been unheard of until now.

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:59.680
What kinds of risks may be hidden within?

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:05.150
Tokugawa Sen, it's not beyond my understanding why you are so afraid of kissing him.

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:06.810
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:07.860
Then what is it?

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:08.730
W-Well...

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:10.150
Wait a second.

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:16.030
There's something wrong with kissing just to become stronger. I feel like I'm betraying myself.

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.740
Things like that should be done with your loved ones-

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:20.370
You sure sound like a virgin.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:23.080
Hey, don't say that! You're a girl!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:25.500
What do you think then, Yukimura?

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:28.880
I-I... don't mind.

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.800
It's just a kiss...

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.890
I don't want a virgin telling me off!

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:38.720
I just said...!

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:41.270
Master samurai are the property of the shogunate.

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:46.810
I won't allow any more actions that may produce other crazed master samurai!

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:52.490
Sanada Yukimura, it seems like I have no choice but to have you leave here.

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:53.110
No way!

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:55.660
I thought you'd say that.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:57.070
In that case!

00:04:57.070 --> 00:05:01.740
I, along with the student council, will stop you from kissing Muneakira no matter what!

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.460
Wait a moment, Senhime-sama.

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:06.920
Bring it on!

00:05:14.510 --> 00:05:15.840
The Next Morning...

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.510
Onii-chan, seconds!

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:22.310
What? Yukki ate it all?

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:27.060
Gosh, Yukki, you're such a glutton-

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:33.360
Huh? I thought Yukki went away?

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:37.910
When I woke up from my dream, I was in another dream!

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:39.820
Good night.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:42.620
I have returned.

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:45.660
Thanks for your assistance, Matabei.

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:47.420
Huh? It's Beta-san.

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:49.670
Good morning, Jyuubei-san.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:51.460
It's not a dream?!

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:52.340
Shut up!

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:01.050
Onii-chan!

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:02.600
Big news!

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:03.600
Good morning, Jyuubei.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.270
Yukki and Beta-san!

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:07.980
Yeah, I guess it surprised you.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:10.100
Huh? Onii-chan, you knew?

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:12.610
What are you making a ruckus so early for?

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:15.690
Oh, Senhime-san, Hanzou-san!

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:17.860
Good morning, Jyuubei-san.

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:23.830
A lot of things happened, so Yukimura and Matabei-san will be using the detached rooms.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:26.870
Yukki and Beta-san will be living here?

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:27.910
For now.

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:29.330
Yay!

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:37.760
Warning!

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:39.970
Warning?

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:45.850
Jyuubei, don't get within three meters of Muneakira. It's forbidden!

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:47.430
Why?

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:51.440
What do you mean "why?" Do you not remember what happened that night?

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:52.270
Nope.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:54.770
Did Jyuubei do something?

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:01.030
Did you lock the door?

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:02.070
Yes.

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:02.570
All right.

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:17.590
I hope you didn't look suspicious to the person at the book store.

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.010
Did not.

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:23.470
I hope you put business books on the top and bottom and made it a sandwich!

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:24.220
I did.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:29.270
I hope you cut the receipt and made it seem as if it were for work!

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:29.980
Indeed.

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:33.650
This is the last one!

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:43.320
A kiss: something to be feared.

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:47.200
Just saying "kiss" isn't enough. Their types widely vary and include those such as the french kiss,

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:50.410
deep kiss, bird kiss, pressure kiss, rhythm kiss,

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:56.040
cocktail kiss, throat kiss, searching kiss, and sky love hurricane kiss.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:58.380
That was close.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:03.760
Indeed, it was correct to concede defeat once and not kiss right then and there.

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:08.390
I knew that I would need some knowledge beforehand, but I didn't know there was this much...

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:10.020
What about a normal one?

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:10.730
Hm?

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:13.560
Is it not acceptable to do a normal kiss?

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:14.810
Normal?

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:16.770
What is a normal kiss?

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:19.730
Well, normal is normal...

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:26.450
Since the definitions of "normal" and "not normal" differ from person to person,

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:31.620
we have to decide on what "normal" is for ourselves!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:33.830
Are you nervous?

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:37.210
I am not.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:40.880
Maybe just a little!

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:49.310
She didn't make a move, did she?

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:53.100
She was probably frightened by Ohii-sama's iron defenses.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:54.770
Entrance Forbidden
I expected nothing less from Ohii-sama.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:55.520
No...
Entrance Forbidden

00:08:57.100 --> 00:08:58.400
She's just scared.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:02.440
There's no way she could kiss him so easily.

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:08.030
Sorry, Beta-san.

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:11.370
Jyuubei doesn't remember anything.

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.950
It's all right, I'm better now.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:17.370
Sorry, Yukki. Are you mad?

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:23.550
You've apologized several times already, so Yukimura-sama isn't angry anymore.

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:28.760
Is Yukki going to kiss with Onii-chan and become stronger?

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:33.430
Do you not want another woman kissing with Muneakira-san?

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:37.850
Yeah, but Jyuubei isn't allowed to say no.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:43.320
I kissed with Onii-chan and hurt everyone, after all.

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:50.370
Onii-chan will be happier if he kissed a girl besides Jyuubei anyway.

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:52.030
Jyuubei-san...

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:34.200
Don't waver, my heart.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:36.000
This is just a means to an end.

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:40.290
It's just that a part of my body is going to momentarily contact him.

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:42.840
You fell for it.

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:46.340
Wh-What?

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:49.680
Tokugawa Sen!

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:51.010
Muneakira!

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:55.430
Too bad, man-stealing massive forehead bitch!

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:56.350
You set this up!

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:58.350
"Don't waver, my heart!"

00:10:58.350 --> 00:11:00.270
"This is just a means to an end!"

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:03.860
What about "this is for the country"?

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:06.320
It's pretty amazing you even spit those words at me as if you were so high and mighty.

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:09.360
D-D-Don't take it the wrong way, I was just...

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:10.820
"It's just that a part of my body..."

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:13.280
"...is going to momentarily contact him."

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:20.210
You're three years too early to kiss someone, Shorty.

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:24.750
Drink milk every day, and grow at least three centimeters.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:26.960
I died...

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:30.300
My pure feelings just died...

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:36.680
Now I'll kiss Muneakira, even if I have to drag myself to him!

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:38.100
Let me see you try.

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:40.230
You'll regret those words.

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:46.980
Operation Kiss: Part One

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:04.670
Operation Kiss: Part Two

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:08.250
All right!

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:21.350
Operation Kiss: Part Three

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:27.900
Operation Kiss: Part Four

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:34.200
Operation Kiss: Part Five

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:39.990
Operation Kiss: Part Six

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:52.010
A small... intermission...

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:54.550
Yukki, are you all right?

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:56.720
If there's something I can help with...

00:12:56.720 --> 00:13:00.850
I already said that this is a war between me and the student council.

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:02.220
There's no need to help out.

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:02.890
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:05.520
Something's wrong.

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:10.900
What am I doing, charging in time after time without any plan?

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:16.740
I guess it's difficult to kiss, even for a genius like Yukki.

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:20.330
It's all a military strategy to make Tokugawa Sen let down her guard.

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.240
Things are just starting!

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:24.040
Oh, Muneakira-san.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.000
Onii-chan!

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:25.830
What is it?

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:28.880
It seemed like they were being pretty awful to you.

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:33.010
I haven't fallen so far as to have pity cast on me by the enemy!

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:35.090
Onii-chan isn't an enemy.

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:36.180
Shut up!

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.140
Listen up, Muneakira.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:42.220
Make sure to brush your teeth well.

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:45.270
In the name of honor, that's the least that you can do for me-

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:51.770
Okay. Looks like there won't be any scarring then.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:54.490
Who do you think I am?!

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:58.570
I'm a samurai. One or two scars won't-

00:13:58.570 --> 00:13:59.370
Yukimura!

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:03.450
Before being a samurai, you're a girl.

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:06.960
It's better to have no scars on your face.

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:10.380
You have to treat yourself better than that.

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:15.510
Fool! Stop making the situation more complex!

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:16.050
Complex?

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:21.890
I mean... I... well... will get in trouble!

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:22.760
Huh?

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:27.350
What am I saying?! At this rate, I'm just going to seem like an idiot!

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:31.770
Should I plan and plan until I drown in my own plot? No, I'll just have to accept it.

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:34.320
Listen, Muneakira!

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:37.740
I-It seems as though, I...

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:39.530
Yukimura...?

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:41.450
I'm... in...

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:43.660
lov-

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:51.500
Muneakira-san! When did Ohii-sama allow you to act on your own?

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:56.710
Please keep Senhime-sama's pain in mind at least a little bit before acting!

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:00.470
Fine, sheesh...

00:15:03.470 --> 00:15:05.680
Yukimura-sama, are you all right?

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:08.770
Yukki, you okay?

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:17.110
Are you tired?

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:18.780
Of course I am.

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:22.410
There's no point getting in her way, yet...

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:23.700
Am I stupid or something?

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:25.330
Ohii-sama...

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:27.870
What?!

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:29.660
It's nothing.

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:30.460
Hmph.

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:35.460
I will always be on your side, Ohii-sama.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:40.130
Please command me as you wish. I will be of help.

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:43.430
Isn't that obvious?

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:47.310
Where are these tea leaves from?!

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:51.310
I don't know, they're for the dojo in general, so...

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:53.980
Are you trying to poison me with this cheap crap?!

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:54.900
Ehh?!

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:58.610
If you'll indeed listen to anything I say, eat all those tea leaves!

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:00.320
Yes, ma'am...

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:01.650
Bath Occupied

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:04.820
I can finally be alone!

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:10.250
I hope Yukimura will give that up.

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:11.910
Sleeping powder, eh?

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:16.790
We'll have to apologize to Senhime-san and Hanzou-san later.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:18.380
Using unnecessary means...

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:22.840
Jyuubei-san, all you did was cooperate with me on my plan.

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:24.220
I alone will take their anger.

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:25.470
Okay.

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:32.890
That aside, Jyuubei, you said that you don't want Muneakira kissing another girl, right?

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:35.900
Yup. But it's okay if it's you.

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:41.650
Because Yukki's the same as Jyuubei. We both like Onii-chan a lot.

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:46.240
Well then, we'll excuse ourselves now.

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.080
Go for it, Yukki!

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.450
You two...

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:51.870
All right!

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:54.620
I guess I'll get out now.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.590
I-Is that...?!

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:05.930
I knew it!

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:10.140
Yukimura!

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:16.270
What are you thinking?!

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:18.900
I put the occupied sign on the door, didn't I?!

00:17:19.570 --> 00:17:24.400
Well, whatever. I'll get out right now, so keep your eyes closed for 10 seconds.

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:30.740
Muneakira.

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:33.500
Would you like it more if my eyes were closed?

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:38.670
From your point of view, well... which is cuter?

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:43.510
A girl who closes her eyes when kissing, or a girl who keeps them open?

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:45.050
Yukimura...

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:46.930
D-Don't!

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:48.300
Please, wait for a moment.

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:49.340
Get out of my way.
Please, wait for a moment.

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:49.470
Remember the warrior's mercy!
Get out of my way.

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:50.220
Remember the warrior's mercy!

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:52.430
Dammit!

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:56.100
It seems like she didn't drink enough of the tea!

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:58.940
We're sorry, Yukimura-sama!

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:03.070
How dare you use such dirty tactics!

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:04.690
Senhime-sama, calm down!

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:11.450
Tokugawa-style naginata skill technique:

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.540
Explosion Wave!

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:28.220
Damn that Tokugawa Sen! Doesn't she know how to hold back?

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:32.260
Muneakira, are you okay? Muneakira!

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:33.970
I'm going... to... drown...

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:37.270
He's just unconscious...

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:52.450
I-I can't. I feel like my heart's going to burst.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:58.500
Muneakira!

00:18:58.500 --> 00:18:59.540
Yes!

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:21.650
Sanada
Yukimura

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:25.320
Sh-She really became a master samurai...

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:30.030
It was just as I thought!

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:32.160
Can you see this, Tokugawa Sen?

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:35.660
Can you see me in the form of a master samurai?

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:36.700
I can't.

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:39.120
Yup, I can't see anything.

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:42.670
Ruining my great unveiling!

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:44.790
I'll just blow this mist away!

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:50.760
Wh-Wh-Wh-What?

00:19:53.180 --> 00:19:54.970
What are you doing, you idiot, Yukimura?

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:56.720
You're so mean, Yukki!

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:57.720
It hurts...

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:00.770
She can't control her power?

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:02.440
At this rate, things are going to get bad!

00:20:07.610 --> 00:20:10.030
A-Are you okay, Muneakira?

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:12.280
I wasn't trying to use a lot of power.

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:16.700
And I know it was an accident, but... uhh...

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:17.450
I'm sorry!

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:18.790
What do you mean, "I'm sorry"?!

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:21.660
I'm not apologizing to <i>you</i> !

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:40.060
The Next Morning...
The Next Morning...

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:46.150
Muneakira...

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:53.820
It's good weather!

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:57.410
You're just going to act like this disaster didn't happen?

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:59.080
It'll be fine, it'll be fine.

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:02.750
Onii-chan's going to work hard and put everything back to normal, after all!

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.580
Right, Onii-chan?

00:21:05.710 --> 00:21:10.710
Putting aside the fact that you put the job of fixing everything on me, what's with this mask?

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:15.430
Until you repent for kissing her, I won't forgive you if you take that off!

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:17.640
I-It wasn't my fault!

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:18.640
Shut up!

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:24.180
I feel like something good might happen today, too!

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:30.610
Tea leaves... delicious...

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:39.990
Hey,
Please Kiss Me?

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:14.290
So, what <i>is</i> this shadow that covers Great Japan, Yukimura?

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:15.960
It's dreadful.

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:17.460
<i>How</i> is it dreadful?

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:18.920
It's terribly dreadful!

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:20.300
That didn't answer my question.

00:23:20.300 --> 00:23:22.340
It's terribly, horribly dreadful!

00:23:22.340 --> 00:23:24.430
Be more specific. I want specifics!

00:23:24.430 --> 00:23:29.640
It's so dreadful, I can't even put it into words!

00:23:29.640 --> 00:23:32.400
Could it be that you don't really know either?

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:34.360
Next time! Hyakka Ryouran:

00:23:34.360 --> 00:23:36.190
The Warrior of
Love Appears

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:37.480
Peel open your eyes and watch it!

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:38.530
She avoided it.
The Warrior of
Love Appears

00:23:38.530 --> 00:23:39.950
The Warrior of
Love Appears
